-const PAGES={"how-it-works.html": {"title": "How Mulemark works | Guides, support & rental records", "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content<\/a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-row\">\n<a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav\"><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"nav-actions\"><a class=\"sign-in\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a class=\"button nav-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Let's talk<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><button aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" hidden=\"\" id=\"mobile-nav\"><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><\/header><main id=\"main\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"container breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"#page=index.html\">Home<\/a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/<\/span><span>How it works<\/span><\/nav><section class=\"container page-hero with-crumb\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">From first scan to final return<\/p><h1>The handoff stays<br/>with the equipment.<\/h1><p class=\"lede\">A physical QR tag opens the right equipment page. Renters get guidance and a path to help. Staff get connected reports and rental-session evidence.<\/p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=demo.html\">Open the equipment examples<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/div><\/section><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"walkthrough\" id=\"walkthrough\"><div aria-label=\"The rental experience\" class=\"walk-tabs\" role=\"tablist\"><button aria-controls=\"panel-start\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-step=\"start\" id=\"step-start\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><span>01<\/span>Quick start<\/button><button aria-controls=\"panel-help\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-step=\"help\" id=\"step-help\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\"><span>02<\/span>Get help<\/button><button aria-controls=\"panel-record\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-step=\"record\" id=\"step-record\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\"><span>03<\/span>Report an issue<\/button><button aria-controls=\"panel-return\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-step=\"return\" id=\"step-return\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\"><span>04<\/span>Close the rental<\/button><\/div><section aria-labelledby=\"step-start\" class=\"walk-panel\" id=\"panel-start\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"walk-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Guidance<\/p><h2>The handoff ends. The guidance shouldn't.<\/h2><p>A renter can forget even a good walkthrough. Someone else may use the machine later. A visual quick-start guide puts the important information back in front of them, at the moment they need it.<\/p><div class=\"walk-proof\">Fewer preventable misunderstandings, with less dependence on memory.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"walk-visual\"><div class=\"public-preview\"><div class=\"preview-top\"><strong>NORTHRIDGE<br/>RENTALS<\/strong><span>EXCAVATOR-017<\/span><\/div><h3>Your guide to this machine.<\/h3><p class=\"small\">Compact excavator \u00b7 Quick Start<\/p><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4H5v18h14V4h-4M9 2h6v4H9zM8 12l2 2 5-5M8 18h7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Before you begin<\/strong><small>Preparation and checks<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 4v16M12 4v16M19 4v16\"><\/path><rect height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" width=\"4\" x=\"3\" y=\"7\"><\/rect><rect height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" width=\"4\" x=\"10\" y=\"14\"><\/rect><rect height=\"4\" rx=\"1\" width=\"4\" x=\"17\" y=\"6\"><\/rect><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Know the controls<\/strong><small>Visual, model-specific reference<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 2v9M6 5a9 9 0 1 0 12 0\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Start &amp; shut down<\/strong><small>Approved guidance in one place<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"preview-foot\">Powered by <img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"10\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"67\"/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section aria-labelledby=\"step-help\" class=\"walk-panel\" hidden=\"\" id=\"panel-help\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"walk-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Support<\/p><h2>Get to the problem, not just the unit number.<\/h2><p>Renters can reach the rental company or submit a support request from the equipment page. The asset is already identified, and photos and a description help the yard understand the situation.<\/p><div class=\"walk-proof\">A more useful support conversation, with less information chasing.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"walk-visual\"><div class=\"public-preview\"><div class=\"preview-top\"><strong>NORTHRIDGE<br/>RENTALS<\/strong><span>EXCAVATOR-017<\/span><\/div><h3>Help for this machine.<\/h3><p class=\"small\">Your rental company, with the asset identified.<\/p><div class=\"preview-box\"><strong>Describe what you are seeing<\/strong><br/>A warning appeared while the machine was in use.<\/div><div class=\"preview-box\">Photo attached \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Renter contact details<\/div><div class=\"preview-button\">Request support<\/div><div class=\"preview-meta\"><div>Equipment<strong>EXCAVATOR-017<\/strong><\/div><div>Submitted from<strong>Equipment page<\/strong><\/div><\/div><div class=\"preview-foot\">Powered by <img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"10\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"67\"/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section aria-labelledby=\"step-record\" class=\"walk-panel\" hidden=\"\" id=\"panel-record\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"walk-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Condition evidence<\/p><h2>Give both sides a way to be heard.<\/h2><p>A renter can document a concern when they notice it. Staff can review the report alongside the outbound record and later return findings for the same rental. A report preserves an observation; it does not decide fault.<\/p><div class=\"walk-proof\">A clearer, fairer conversation based on connected records.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"walk-visual\"><div class=\"public-preview\"><div class=\"preview-top\"><strong>NORTHRIDGE<br/>RENTALS<\/strong><span>EXCAVATOR-017<\/span><\/div><h3>Put a concern on record.<\/h3><p class=\"small\">Asset, photo and submission time together.<\/p><div class=\"preview-box\"><strong>Renter report<\/strong><br/>Noticed a damaged panel before using the equipment.<\/div><div class=\"preview-box\">1 photo \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Report reference<\/div><div class=\"preview-meta\"><div>Equipment<strong>EXCAVATOR-017<\/strong><\/div><div>Rental record<strong>Connected session<\/strong><\/div><\/div><div class=\"preview-button\">Report an issue<\/div><div class=\"preview-foot\">Powered by <img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"10\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"67\"/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section aria-labelledby=\"step-return\" class=\"walk-panel\" hidden=\"\" id=\"panel-return\" role=\"tabpanel\"><div class=\"walk-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Return workflow<\/p><h2>A return should close the rental, not start an investigation.<\/h2><p>Renter information and the staff return checklist stay connected to the rental session. Photos, condition findings and earlier reports give the team a more complete starting point for review.<\/p><div class=\"walk-proof\">Fewer disconnected records and less reconstruction after return.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"walk-visual\"><div class=\"public-preview\"><div class=\"preview-top\"><strong>NORTHRIDGE<br/>RENTALS<\/strong><span>EXCAVATOR-017<\/span><\/div><h3>A clearer return.<\/h3><p class=\"small\">Review the rental before closing it out.<\/p><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 6h4l2-3h6l2 3h4v15H3z\"><\/path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"4\"><\/circle><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Outbound condition<\/strong><small>Staff photos and notes<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 3h10l4 4v14H5zM14 3v5h5M8 12h8M8 16h6\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Renter report<\/strong><small>Concern captured during the rental<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"guide-row\"><div class=\"guide-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 4H5v18h14V4h-4M9 2h6v4H9zM8 12l2 2 5-5M8 18h7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div><strong>Return checklist<\/strong><small>Staff findings and photos<\/small><\/div><\/div><div class=\"preview-foot\">Powered by <img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"10\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"67\"/><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><p class=\"walk-caption\">Workflow illustrations, not screenshots. Use the equipment examples to explore the actual product. Guide panels are a content format, not operating instructions.<\/p><\/div>\n<section aria-label=\"What comes with the experience\" class=\"details-grid\"><article><h2>Your brand.<br/>Their equipment page.<\/h2><p>The renter sees your company first. Equipment identity, guidance, support contacts and reporting belong to the machine in front of them. Mulemark stays in a supporting role.<\/p><\/article><article><h2>One asset.<br/>A connected record.<\/h2><p>Outbound condition, renter reports and staff return findings can be reviewed in the context of the same rental. Submissions do not have to live as isolated forms or loose photographs.<\/p><\/article><article><h2>Implemented with you.<br/>Not left with you.<\/h2><p>Agree the asset group, configure the pages, verify tag-to-asset links and introduce the workflows to your team. Content and installation work are scoped before rollout.<\/p><\/article><\/section>\n<section class=\"faq-section\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Practical questions<\/p><h2>Before we talk.<\/h2><p>The things an owner or operations team should know before planning a pilot.<\/p><\/div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details><summary>Does this replace our rental software?<\/summary><p>No. Mulemark handles equipment guidance, support, reporting and rental-condition records. Reservations, contracts, dispatch, invoicing and payments remain in your rental-management system. Working alongside that system does not imply an existing software integration.<\/p><\/details><details><summary>Do renters need an app or account?<\/summary><p>No. Renters open the equipment page with their phone camera and browser. Staff sign in to access employee workflows and private rental records.<\/p><\/details><details><summary>Who supplies the operating instructions?<\/summary><p>The rental company supplies or approves equipment-specific information. The intended pictographic guides are concise references, not substitutes for operator training, manufacturer instructions or required safety procedures.<\/p><\/details><details><summary>Can a renter see the entire asset history?<\/summary><p>The public equipment page is separate from authenticated staff records. Reporting an issue does not open other customers' rental history. A fair process does not mean making private rental evidence public.<\/p><\/details><details><summary>How would a pilot work?<\/summary><p>Start with a defined group of assets and an agreed scope. Set up equipment pages, tags and staff workflows, then review actual use and operational value with your team. Asset counts, implementation and commercial terms are agreed directly.<\/p><\/details><details><summary>Can I open an actual equipment page?<\/summary><p>Yes. <a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Open an equipment example<\/a> using the same Mulemark QR codes shown on this site. The step-by-step panels above are explanatory illustrations; they do not submit reports.<\/p><\/details><\/div><\/section><\/div><section class=\"container contact-band\"><div><h2>Put it in your operating context.<\/h2><p>Tell us where your handoffs, support calls or returns become difficult.<\/p><\/div><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Talk about your fleet<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/section><\/main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a><p>Guidance, support and a clearer record.<br/>Right there on the equipment.<\/p><\/div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\" class=\"footer-links\"><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About Mulemark<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><a href=\"#page=credits.html\">Image credits<\/a><a href=\"#page=website-information.html\">Website information<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"footer-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:support@mulemark.io\">support@mulemark.io<\/a><a href=\"tel:+16729664293\">Canada +1 672-966-4293<\/a><a href=\"tel:+14422224293\">USA +1 442-222-4293<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Mulemark<\/span><span>Marketing: getmulemark.com \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Product: <a href=\"https://mulemark.io\">mulemark.io<\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/footer><dialog aria-labelledby=\"scene-dialog-title\" class=\"scene-dialog\" id=\"scene-dialog\"><div class=\"scene-dialog-head\"><h2 id=\"scene-dialog-title\">Tag placement<\/h2><button aria-label=\"Close placement\" class=\"scene-close\" type=\"button\">Close \u00d7<\/button><\/div><div class=\"scene-dialog-content\"><\/div><p class=\"small muted\">Proposed tag placement on a real photograph. The larger tag detail is provided separately for scanning.<\/p><\/dialog>"}, "website-information.html": {"title": "Website information | Mulemark", "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content<\/a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-row\">\n<a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"nav-actions\"><a class=\"sign-in\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a class=\"button nav-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Let's talk<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><button aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" hidden=\"\" id=\"mobile-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><\/header><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"container breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"#page=index.html\">Home<\/a><span>/<\/span><span>Website information<\/span><\/div><section class=\"container page-hero with-crumb\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Using this marketing website<\/p><h1>Contact and<br/>website information.<\/h1><\/section><section class=\"container credits-list\"><article><h2>Contacting Mulemark<\/h2><p>Email links open your email application; telephone links open your device's calling application. This marketing site does not silently send an enquiry or store contact-form entries. If you email Josh, the information you choose to include is handled in the support mailbox.<\/p><\/article><article><h2>Technical requests<\/h2><p>This implementation does not include advertising pixels, analytics scripts or marketing cookies. The hosting provider may process standard connection and security information. Preview versions request licensed photographs and webfonts from external providers; the publishing build downloads these to the site's own assets directory.<\/p><\/article><article><h2>Equipment examples<\/h2><p>Equipment-page links open the separate Mulemark application at mulemark.io. Application functions such as scan activity and report submission are separate from this marketing site. Review the application's notices before submitting information.<\/p><\/article><article><h2>Questions<\/h2><p>Contact <a href=\"mailto:support@mulemark.io\">support@mulemark.io<\/a> for questions about this website or an enquiry you have sent. This information describes this website implementation, not a retention promise or a substitute for customer agreements.<\/p><\/article><\/section><\/main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a><p>Guidance, support and a clearer record.<br/>Right there on the equipment.<\/p><\/div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\" class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About Mulemark<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><a href=\"#page=credits.html\">Image credits<\/a><a href=\"#page=website-information.html\">Website information<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"footer-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:support@mulemark.io\">support@mulemark.io<\/a><a href=\"tel:+16729664293\">Canada +1 672-966-4293<\/a><a href=\"tel:+14422224293\">USA +1 442-222-4293<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Mulemark<\/span><span>Marketing: getmulemark.com \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Product: <a href=\"https://mulemark.io\">mulemark.io<\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/footer><dialog aria-labelledby=\"scene-dialog-title\" class=\"scene-dialog\" id=\"scene-dialog\"><div class=\"scene-dialog-head\"><h2 id=\"scene-dialog-title\">Tag placement<\/h2><button aria-label=\"Close placement\" class=\"scene-close\" type=\"button\">Close \u00d7<\/button><\/div><div class=\"scene-dialog-content\"><\/div><p class=\"small muted\">Proposed tag placement on a real photograph. The larger tag detail is provided separately for scanning.<\/p><\/dialog>"}, "about.html": {"title": "About Mulemark | Built from an operations perspective", "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content<\/a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-row\">\n<a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"nav-actions\"><a class=\"sign-in\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a class=\"button nav-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Let's talk<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><button aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" hidden=\"\" id=\"mobile-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><\/header><main id=\"main\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"container breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"#page=index.html\">Home<\/a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/<\/span><span>About Mulemark<\/span><\/nav><section class=\"container about-top\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">About Mulemark<\/p><h1>Built around the moment<br/>someone needs an answer.<\/h1><p class=\"lede\">The machine is right there. The instructions, support contact or condition photo should not be somewhere else.<\/p><\/div><aside aria-label=\"Founder profile\" class=\"founder-panel\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Founder-led. Operations-first.<\/p><img alt=\"\" height=\"41\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"67\"/><h2>Josh Paetz<\/h2><p>Founder, Mulemark<\/p><div class=\"founder-facts\">Industrial operations and manufacturing leadership<br/>Process improvement and quality systems<br/>Abbotsford, British Columbia<\/div><\/aside><\/section>\n<section class=\"container editorial\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The problem behind the product<\/p><h2>A great explanation only helps if it is still there when you need it.<\/h2><\/div><div><p>A walkthrough happens once. A rental can last for days or weeks. The operator may change, the details may be forgotten, and the question may not arise until the equipment reaches the jobsite.<\/p><p>Mulemark is built around a simple idea: keep the useful guidance, support path and reporting tools with the equipment. Give the renter a clear way forward, and give the rental company a more useful record of what happens.<\/p><p>The QR code is the access point. The value is what the person can do after the scan.<\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section class=\"container editorial\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Why fairness matters<\/p><h2>Neither side should have to rely on memory.<\/h2><\/div><div><p>During an RV rental, Josh saw the owner help push a binding slide outward during the initial walkthrough. When the RV came back, the fault was attributed to the renters. There was no clear, shared record of the condition at handoff.<\/p><p>That experience illustrates why a simple way to document a concern matters to both parties. A record should help establish the facts, whether those facts support the rental company or the customer.<\/p><p>Mulemark gives renters a way to report what they notice and helps staff connect those reports with the equipment and rental session. It supports a fair review; it does not automatically determine responsibility.<\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section class=\"container editorial\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">An operations perspective<\/p><h2>Useful to the renter.<br/>Workable for the yard.<\/h2><\/div><div><p>Josh's background is in industrial operations, manufacturing leadership, process improvement and quality systems. That perspective shapes Mulemark: the front-line workflow has to be practical, and the record has to be useful when someone needs to act on it.<\/p><p>Mulemark is being developed as a focused addition to the rental business, not a replacement for reservations, contracts or billing. Early deployments are founder-led, with a defined asset group and a clear implementation scope.<\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section aria-label=\"Product principles\" class=\"container principles\"><article><h3>Make the first scan useful.<\/h3><p>Start with guidance people can understand. Keep help and reporting easy to find.<\/p><\/article><article><h3>Preserve the context.<\/h3><p>Connect observations to the asset and rental, rather than creating another pile of disconnected information.<\/p><\/article><article><h3>Earn the next rollout.<\/h3><p>Use real deployments to learn what customers use, what creates work and what they value enough to keep.<\/p><\/article><\/section><section class=\"container contact-band\"><div><h2>Talk to the person building it.<\/h2><p>Bring a real handoff, support or return problem from your operation.<\/p><\/div><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Talk about your fleet<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/section><\/main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a><p>Guidance, support and a clearer record.<br/>Right there on the equipment.<\/p><\/div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\" class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=about.html\">About Mulemark<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><a href=\"#page=credits.html\">Image credits<\/a><a href=\"#page=website-information.html\">Website information<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"footer-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:support@mulemark.io\">support@mulemark.io<\/a><a href=\"tel:+16729664293\">Canada +1 672-966-4293<\/a><a href=\"tel:+14422224293\">USA +1 442-222-4293<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Mulemark<\/span><span>Marketing: getmulemark.com \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Product: <a href=\"https://mulemark.io\">mulemark.io<\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/footer><dialog aria-labelledby=\"scene-dialog-title\" class=\"scene-dialog\" id=\"scene-dialog\"><div class=\"scene-dialog-head\"><h2 id=\"scene-dialog-title\">Tag placement<\/h2><button aria-label=\"Close placement\" class=\"scene-close\" type=\"button\">Close \u00d7<\/button><\/div><div class=\"scene-dialog-content\"><\/div><p class=\"small muted\">Proposed tag placement on a real photograph. The larger tag detail is provided separately for scanning.<\/p><\/dialog>"}, "equipment-tags.html": {"title": "QR equipment tags for rental fleets | Mulemark", "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content<\/a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-row\">\n<a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"nav-actions\"><a class=\"sign-in\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a class=\"button nav-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Let's talk<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><button aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" hidden=\"\" id=\"mobile-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><\/header><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"container breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"#page=index.html\">Home<\/a><span>/<\/span><span>Equipment tags<\/span><\/div>\n<section class=\"container tag-intro-v3\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">The physical access point<\/p><h1>Easy to spot.<br/>Worth scanning.<\/h1><p class=\"lede\">Put the tag where the renter already looks: beside the entry, seat or controls. Make the QR the main event. Keep guidance, help and reporting one scan away.<\/p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=demo.html\">Try the equipment pages<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><a class=\"outline-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Discuss your fleet<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/div><\/div>\n<div class=\"tag-showcase\"><div aria-label=\"Tag finish\" class=\"finish-switch\" role=\"group\"><button aria-pressed=\"true\" data-finish=\"iron\" type=\"button\">Iron<\/button><button aria-pressed=\"false\" data