870Q4877 700 4881.0 696.0Q4885 692 4885 685V446Q4885 443 4887.0 442.0Q4889 441 4891 444L5065 691Q5071 700 5084 700H5263Q5275 700 5275 691Q5275 687 5272 682L5064 393Q5062 390 5064 386L5279 18Q5282 14 5282 9Q5282 0 5269 0H5092Q5079 0 5074 10L4936 256Q4935 259 4933.0 259.0Q4931 259 4929 256L4887 192Q4885 188 4885 186V15Q4885 8 4881.0 4.0Q4877 0 4870 0H4712Q4705 0 4701.0 4.0Q4697 8 4697 15Z\" fill=\"#FAF9F6\"><\/path><\/g>\n<\/svg>\n<\/svg><\/a><div class=\"scan-detail-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The tag, enlarged<\/p><h3>Start here.<br/>Come back anytime.<\/h3><p>Scan the code, or open the same equipment page.<\/p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/t/demo-tr014\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Open equipment example <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/div><\/div><\/article><\/div><p class=\"field-note\">Photographs show real equipment; tag placements are composites, not customer installations. The enlarged tag opens a demonstration asset, which may differ from the photographed model. <a href=\"#page=credits.html\">Image credits<\/a>.<\/p><\/section>\n<section class=\"container placement-guide\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Placement before decoration<\/p><h2>Close to the operator.<br/>Clear of the work.<\/h2><\/div><div><p>Choose a fixed, visible surface near the approach to the machine or its controls. Keep handles, sightlines, warning labels and moving parts unobstructed.<\/p><p>Check reach, glare and scan distance on the actual equipment before deciding the tag size and attachment. A good placement is useful on day one and easy to return to later.<\/p><\/div><\/section>\n<section class=\"container contact-band\"><div><h2>Make it fit your fleet.<\/h2><p>Start with the equipment, the renter and the information they need.<\/p><\/div><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Talk about your fleet<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/section><\/main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a><p>Guidance, support and a clearer record.<br/>Right there on the equipment.<\/p><\/div><nav aria-label=\"Footer navigation\" class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About Mulemark<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><a href=\"#page=credits.html\">Image credits<\/a><a href=\"#page=website-information.html\">Website information<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"footer-contact\"><a href=\"mailto:support@mulemark.io\">support@mulemark.io<\/a><a href=\"tel:+16729664293\">Canada +1 672-966-4293<\/a><a href=\"tel:+14422224293\">USA +1 442-222-4293<\/a><\/div><\/div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>\u00a9 2026 Mulemark<\/span><span>Marketing: getmulemark.com \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 Product: <a href=\"https://mulemark.io\">mulemark.io<\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/footer><dialog aria-labelledby=\"scene-dialog-title\" class=\"scene-dialog\" id=\"scene-dialog\"><div class=\"scene-dialog-head\"><h2 id=\"scene-dialog-title\">Tag placement<\/h2><button aria-label=\"Close placement\" class=\"scene-close\" type=\"button\">Close \u00d7<\/button><\/div><div class=\"scene-dialog-content\"><\/div><p class=\"small muted\">Proposed tag placement on a real photograph. The larger tag detail is provided separately for scanning.<\/p><\/dialog>"}, "index.html": {"title": "Rental equipment guidance, QR tags & support | Mulemark", "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content<\/a><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container nav-row\">\n<a aria-label=\"Mulemark home\" class=\"brand-link\" href=\"#page=index.html\"><img alt=\"Mulemark\" height=\"23\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"210\"/><\/a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><div class=\"nav-actions\"><a class=\"sign-in\" href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a class=\"button nav-button\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Let's talk<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><button aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"menu-toggle\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\"><\/path><\/svg><\/button><\/div><\/div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\" class=\"mobile-nav\" hidden=\"\" id=\"mobile-nav\"><a href=\"#page=how-it-works.html\">How it works<\/a><a href=\"#page=equipment-tags.html\">Equipment tags<\/a><a href=\"#page=about.html\">About<\/a><a href=\"#page=contact.html\">Contact Josh<\/a><a href=\"https://mulemark.io/login\">Product sign in<\/a><a href=\"#page=demo.html\">Equipment examples<\/a><\/nav><\/header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"container hero hero-v3\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Equipment guidance, support &amp; rental records<\/p><h1>Your best handoff.<br/><span>On every machine.<\/span><\/h1><p class=\"hero-lede\">Give renters a clear start, guidance that stays with the equipment, a direct path to help, and a fair record from handoff through return.<\/p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"#page=demo.html\">Explore an equipment page<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#page=contact.html\">Talk about your fleet <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 5l7 7-7 7\"><\/path><\/svg><\/a><\/div><p class=\"hero-qualifier\">No renter app. No renter account. Keep your rental system.<\/p><div class=\"hero-points\"><span>Clear guidance<\/span><span>Accessible support<\/span><span>Connected records<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"hero-evidence\"><figure class=\"field-figure\" data-scene=\"excavator\"><button aria-label=\"Enlarge Bobcat E20 placement\" class=\"scene-open\" data-scene-id=\"excavator\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"scene-title-home\" class=\"field-svg\" role=\"img\" viewbox=\"0 0 1200 881.13723346\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<title id=\"scene-title-home\">Real photograph of a Bobcat E20 with a proposed Mulemark tag beside the operator entry<\/title>\n<image class=\"source-photo\" data-local-photo=\"assets/photos/bobcat-e20.jpg\" data-photo-id=\"excavator\" height=\"881.13723346\" href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fb/Bobcat_E20_Mini_Excavator.jpg/1280px-Bobcat_E20_Mini_Excavator.jpg\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" width=\"1200\"/>\n<g class=\"mounted-tag\" transform=\"matrix(0.0520000000 0.0102799344 0.0000000000 0.0538472754 242.40000000 428.23269546)\">\n<title>Mulemark equipment tag | EXCAVATOR-017<\/title><desc>Exact supplied QR modules, four-module quiet zone, supplied Mulemark outline artwork. A layout concept, not installation approv